{"id":519,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>近日，第五届仪器仪表学会毕业设计大赛评选结果正式揭晓。我院学子在本次大赛中表现突出、成果显著，荣获多项重要奖项。学院荣获大赛团体一等奖，学生参赛作品荣获一等奖2项、二等奖4项、三等奖2项。</p><p>此次优异成绩的取得，充分彰显了我院实践教学与人才培养工作的扎实成效。下一步，学院将持续深化教育教学改革，优化实践育人体系，力争在各类学科竞赛中取得新的更大成绩。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9MRVA2U4fRL8laL1l-ZM87PU8rkolrm7MNlZMm78U87PM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhVLYhfM1ybL47PMRL8M4lZMmLDLzUPo7-8nlWfMRQVolnFUmv8M4NiMNWFLNl4nNlJv2bjo4OeosTP_InE_dN0qIbtpYyPLmGsg4LZLRvZgtA8pUNcc&oid=1395300322&tid=1207&nid=38078&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7E3A693114347586361418B4EBA46E9D/B747956B/2E3FE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9MlnAfnmNPL8-YL1NC8Mm7iU4rRL4rmfMRNYUz62Mzl4Mz70gihFp2hmCIa0okysn1yZUSyaLNW2ozVRnR9DM4N8LNnkLNCPoRA7Mm9sMRVFL8r7L4GinmnFoRNbU4CJv2bjo4OeosTP_InE_dN0qIbtpYyPLmGsg4LZLRvZgtA8pUNcc&oid=1395300322&tid=1207&nid=38078&e=.png\"></p><p>初审：耿精</p><p>二审：王红亮</p><p>三审：刘文怡</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://6y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9MRVA2U4fRL8laL1l-ZM87PU8rkolrm7MNlZMm78U87PM7C0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhVLYhfM1ybL47PMRL8M4lZMmLDLzUPo7-8nlWfMRQVolnFUmv8M4NiMNWFLNl4nNlJv2bjo4OeosTP_InE_dN0qIbtpYyPLmGsg4LZLRvZgtA8pUNcc&oid=1395300322&tid=1207&nid=38078&e=.png"}